I tell ILAIOS the outcome
        │
        ▼
ILAIOS understands the goal
        │
        ▼
ILAIOS plans bounded work
        │
        ▼
ILAIOS obtains authorized context
        │
        ▼
ILAIOS selects capabilities
        │
        ▼
ILAIOS executes under policy
        │
        ▼
